# Page 8 — Not autogenerated by Lean — user-code duplicates

Filtering out every group that contains a Lean-generated name (`match_`, `_simp_`,
`_private`, `.rec`, `.mk`, `_default`, `_unsafe_rec`, …) leaves **560** groups
whose members are *all* hand-written declarations.

By class among those user-code groups:

| class | groups |
|---|---|
| independent | 344 |
| unknown | 113 |
| deprecated | 91 |
| alias | 11 |
| rfl-variant | 1 |

**The honest reading.** Among these, the `deprecated` groups (91)
are the clearest true duplicates: a Mathlib declaration was renamed and the old name
kept as a deprecated shim. A representative sample:

| deprecated (old / shim) | survivor |
|---|---|
| `CategoryTheory.Localization.LeftBousfield.W_iff_isIso_map` | `CategoryTheory.ObjectProperty.isLocal_iff_isIso_map` |
| `MeasureTheory.Submartingale.stoppedValue_leastGE_eLpNorm_le'` | `MeasureTheory.Submartingale.eLpNorm_stoppedAbove_le'` |
| `Quaternion.one_im` | `Quaternion.im_one` |
| `DFinsupp.lex_lt_iff` | `DFinsupp.Lex.lt_iff` |
| `NonemptyFinLinOrd.hom_comp` | `NonemptyFinLinOrd.hom_hom_comp` |
| `Cubic.disc` | `Cubic.discr` |
| `EMetric.diam_one` | `Metric.ediam_one` |
| `Module.associatedPrimes.mem_associatePrimes_localizedModule_atPrime_of_mem_associated_primes` | `Module.associatedPrimes.mem_associatedPrimes_atPrime_of_mem_associatedPrimes` |
| `List.Chain.backwards_induction_head` | `List.IsChain.backwards_cons_induction_head` |
